-- The shared vocabulary (MMS-521): one declaration for each thing two or
-- more instruments speak about, so that each can state its claim in the
-- same terms and the root (l4/lib/root.l4) can line the claims up. An
-- instrument's file imports this module and adds `<item> according to
-- <instrument>`, defined from its own rules; nothing here computes a claim.
--
-- It imports the prelude, the conventions and the takanon's introduction
-- (for the kinds of source) only, so that any module can import it — the
-- takanon's §1.1 among them, which the calculator ships.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT terms

§ `אוצר המילים המשותף — מה שכמה מסמכים מדברים עליו`

§§ `המסמך`

-- Who signed a collective agreement, as its own preamble names the parties
-- (MMS-686): of two agreements of the same parties on the same matter, the
-- later replaces the earlier (l4/lib/agreements-root.l4).
@desc A party that signed a collective agreement.
DECLARE `signatory` IS ONE OF
    `the State, as a signatory`
    `the Centre of Local Government, as a signatory`
    `the three large cities, as a signatory`
    `Histadrut HaMorim, as a signatory`
    `the secondary teachers' organisation, as a signatory`

-- How an instrument describes itself, in its own file: which module encodes
-- it, its name, its kind as the takanon's introduction tells sources apart,
-- its date, the parties that signed it (a collective agreement's; EMPTY for
-- any other instrument), and the two facts §29 of the Budget Foundations
-- Law asks of what it gives. A collection's root lists the instruments it
-- includes.
@desc An instrument that may speak to a pay item.
DECLARE `instrument` HAS
    `module`        IS A STRING @desc the L4 module that encodes it
    `title`         IS A STRING @desc its name, in Hebrew
    `kind`          IS A `kind of source` @desc as the takanon's introduction tells sources apart
    `is the takanon` IS A BOOLEAN
    `issued`        IS A DATE
    `signed by`     IS A LIST OF `signatory` @desc the parties that signed it, as its preamble names them; EMPTY for an instrument that is not a collective agreement
    `practised for all state employees` IS A BOOLEAN @desc what it gives is as agreed or practised for all state employees (§29(א))
    `approved by the Finance Minister`  IS A BOOLEAN @desc what it gives was approved by the Finance Minister (§29(א))

§§ `המעסיק`

-- Who employs the teaching employee, as far as the instruments that speak
-- of the 2008 supplement tell employers apart: the State; a local
-- authority (the three large cities among them), a party to the agreement
-- of 24.1.2008; or another owner of schools (a network, a corporation), to
-- which the owners' circulars are addressed together with the local
-- authorities.
DECLARE `the teacher's employer` IS ONE OF
    `employed by the State`
    `employed by a local authority`
    `employed by another owning body`

GIVEN e IS A `the teacher's employer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is an owning body` e IF
    NOT e EQUALS `employed by the State`

§§ `פריטי השכר`

-- The pay items two or more instruments speak about. Each is asked of the
-- root as one question — `the answer that governs` item case — whatever
-- instruments speak to it; a new item is a new constructor here, its
-- facts in the case below, and its claims in the instruments' files.
DECLARE `pay item` IS ONE OF
    @desc "תוספת 2008": the public-sector wage supplement of 2008 for teaching employees not in a reform
    `the 2008 public-sector supplement`
    @desc "גמול רכז פדגוגי": the pedagogical coordinator's role allowance, as a share of the combined salary
    `the pedagogical coordinator's allowance rate`
    @desc "גמול חונך": a mentor's role allowance for the interns the mentor accompanies, as a share of the combined salary
    `the mentor's allowance rate`
    @desc "גמול ניהול חטיבה צעירה": the junior-division head's role allowance, in shekels, at a full position
    `the junior-division head's allowance`
    @desc "מספר גמולי התפקיד": how many role allowances a teacher holding several roles is paid
    `the role allowances counted`
    @desc "השכר המשולב למשרה מלאה": the combined salary of one full position, by the salary table, the seniority and the grade
    `the combined salary of a full position`
    @desc "תוספת 2001": the 3% wage supplement on the combined salary from 1.1.2001
    `the 3% supplement of 2001`
    @desc "תוספת 2011": the public-sector wage supplement of 2011 for teaching employees off the reform, on the combined salary and the 2001 and 2008 supplements
    `the 2011 public-sector supplement`
    @desc "תוספת הסכם הוראה 94": the shekel supplement of the 1994 teaching agreement, for one full position
    `the 1994 supplement of a full position`
    @desc "תוספת אופק 2022": the Ofek Hadash reform's shekel supplement by grade from 1.9.2022 (the wage agreement of 19.10.2022, §5), for one full position
    `the Ofek 2022 supplement of a full position`

GIVEN i IS A `pay item`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the name of the item` i IS
    CONSIDER i
    WHEN `the 2008 public-sector supplement` THEN "תוספת 2008"
    WHEN `the pedagogical coordinator's allowance rate` THEN "גמול רכז פדגוגי"
    WHEN `the mentor's allowance rate` THEN "גמול חונך"
    WHEN `the junior-division head's allowance` THEN "גמול ניהול חטיבה צעירה"
    WHEN `the role allowances counted` THEN "מספר גמולי התפקיד"
    WHEN `the combined salary of a full position` THEN "השכר המשולב למשרה מלאה"
    WHEN `the 3% supplement of 2001` THEN "תוספת 2001 (3%)"
    WHEN `the 2011 public-sector supplement` THEN "תוספת 2011"
    WHEN `the 1994 supplement of a full position` THEN "תוספת הסכם הוראה 94 למשרה מלאה"
    WHEN `the Ofek 2022 supplement of a full position` THEN "תוספת אופק 2022 למשרה מלאה"

§§ `כשאין תשובה`

-- Why a provision gives no answer (MMS-538; the client, 2026-10-21: "we
-- will need some way to differentiate between knowledge we don't have yet
-- (or haven't encoded yet) and lacunas"). A named input looks like a value
-- and says nothing of why it is one; an instrument states instead which of
-- these it is, once, as data. Only a lacuna is a flaw of the law (a finding
-- of kind gap), and it may be declared only where the whole provision and
-- everything it cites is held: where a page it depends on is missing, the
-- answer is missing, not silent.
@desc Why an instrument's provision gives no answer.
DECLARE `why there is no answer` IS ONE OF
    @desc the text is whole and does not answer: a lacuna, with its gap finding
    `the text is silent`  HAS `the finding on the silence` IS A STRING
    @desc the words exist, and the corpus does not hold them: a page the scan lacks, a table not transcribed, a document held without its words
    `the text is missing` HAS `the span the corpus lacks` IS A STRING
    @desc an instrument the corpus holds and the L4 has not encoded yet
    `not yet encoded`     HAS `the instrument still to encode` IS A STRING
    @desc an instrument the corpus does not hold, by design
    `outside the corpus`  HAS `the instrument outside the corpus` IS A STRING
    @desc the text sends the answer elsewhere ("הסכומים נקבעים על-ידי האוצר"): no flaw
    `set elsewhere`       HAS `the body that sets it` IS A STRING

-- What a gap says, in Hebrew, for a page that shows why the law gives no
-- answer.
GIVEN w IS A `why there is no answer`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `what the gap says` w IS
    CONSIDER w
    WHEN `the text is silent` f THEN CONCAT "הטקסט שותק (", f, ")"
    WHEN `the text is missing` s THEN CONCAT "הטקסט חסר בקורפוס: ", s
    WHEN `not yet encoded` i THEN CONCAT "טרם קודד: ", i
    WHEN `outside the corpus` i THEN CONCAT "מחוץ לקורפוס: ", i
    WHEN `set elsewhere` b THEN CONCAT "נקבע במקום אחר: ", b

§§ `המשרה בטבלאות השכר`

-- Where a teacher of the Ofek Hadash reform sits in its salary tables: the
-- post (the tables of principals, adjacent junior-high principals and
-- first deputies are their own), the education that picks the table (the
-- base agreement's §36(ב)–(ד) for the academic tables, the rank the
-- non-academic tables print in their titles), the seniority, the grade,
-- and for a principal or a first deputy the school's complexity level.
DECLARE `the post in the reform's tables` IS ONE OF
    `a teacher in the tables`
    `a principal in the tables`
    `an adjacent junior-high principal in the tables`
    `a first deputy in the tables`

DECLARE `the education the tables ask` IS ONE OF
    `with a first degree`
    `with a second degree`
    `with a doctorate`
    `non-academic of senior rank`
    `non-academic of certified rank`
    `non-academic and uncertified`

§§ `בית הספר`

-- The schools the owners' employment circulars are addressed to, one
-- circular a year for each: a recognised-unofficial special-education
-- school (תש"ף/1 … תשפ"ו/1), and a recognised-unofficial primary school of
-- the Ma'ayan HaChinuch HaTorani or Chinuch Atzmai networks (תשפ"ד/1), and
-- a recognised-unofficial special-education kindergarten (תשפ"ד/3,
-- תשפ"ה/2, תשפ"ו/2); and, beside those two special-education settings, the
-- official junior high of a six-year school, the third addressee of
-- circular תשפ"ג/4 (MMS-616).
-- Any other school is one no owners' circular in the root speaks to.
DECLARE `the kind of school in the case` IS ONE OF
    `a recognised unofficial special-education school`
    `a Ma'ayan HaChinuch HaTorani or Chinuch Atzmai primary school`
    `a recognised unofficial special-education kindergarten`
    `an official junior high of a six-year school`
    `another school`

§§ `המקרה`

-- What any instrument may ask about a teaching employee in a salary month,
-- in one record: an item uses the facts it needs and ignores the rest.
@desc A teaching employee's salary month, as far as any instrument speaking to a pay item asks about it.
DECLARE `teaching case` HAS
    `the salary month`                IS A DATE    @desc any day of the salary month
    `employer`                        IS A `the teacher's employer`
    `in post-primary education`       IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed in post-primary (על-יסודי) education
    `in the upper division`           IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed in the upper division (חטיבה עליונה)
    `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc represented by ארגון המורים בבתי הספר העל-יסודיים
    `in a population whose 5% step was put off` IS A BOOLEAN @desc one of the four populations the agreement of 17.6.2009 put off to October 2011
    `combined salary today`                 IS A NUMBER  @desc the combined salary at its current value, at the teacher's position
    `supplement 2001 today`                 IS A NUMBER  @desc תוספת 2001 at its current value
    `supplement 2008 today`                 IS A NUMBER  @desc תוספת 2008 as the law gives it that month (with the 2001 supplement, the base of the 2011 supplement)
    `combined salary in December 2007` IS A NUMBER @desc the combined salary at its value in December 2007
    `supplement 2001 in December 2007` IS A NUMBER @desc תוספת 2001 at its value in December 2007
    `the kind of school`               IS A `the kind of school in the case` @desc the school the teacher is employed in, as the owners' circulars tell them apart
    `holds the pedagogical coordinator's role` IS A BOOLEAN @desc appointed pedagogical coordinator (curriculum planning), the role the agreement of 19.3.2017 adds (§3(ג))
    `the interns the teacher mentors`  IS A NUMBER @desc how many interns the teacher is appointed to mentor; 0 if none (one or more: the teacher holds the mentor's role)
    `heads the junior division`        IS A BOOLEAN @desc appointed head of the junior division (מנהל/ת חטיבה צעירה)
    `the classes in each grade`        IS A NUMBER @desc the classes in each grade of the division the teacher heads or coordinates
    `the roles the teacher holds`      IS A NUMBER @desc how many roles carrying a role allowance the teacher holds, of those a cap on their number counts; 0 if none
    `a further role approved by the district manager` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the district manager approved paying a role allowance beyond the second
    `paid by the Ofek Hadash tables`  IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed under the Ofek Hadash reform, paid by its salary tables
    `the post in the reform`          IS A `the post in the reform's tables` @desc for a teacher of the reform: the post whose tables pay him
    `the education`                   IS A `the education the tables ask` @desc for a teacher of the reform: the degree, or the rank of a teacher without one
    `the seniority the tables count`  IS A NUMBER @desc for a teacher of the reform: the seniority for pay, a new teacher's being 1 (the completion agreement of 29.2.2012, §23(א))
    `the grade in the tables`         IS A NUMBER @desc for a teacher of the reform: the grade, 1 to 9 or an intermediate one (a principal's or deputy's א 1, א+ 1.5 … ד 4)
    `the school's complexity level`   IS A NUMBER @desc for a principal or first deputy of the reform: the school's complexity level, 1 to 8

-- Whether the case's salary month is month m of year y or later: any day
-- of the month says which month it is (convention dates.start).
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`, y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the salary month is at least` c y m IF
    (c's `the salary month`) `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 m y)

-- Whether the case's salary month falls in the school year that starts on
-- 1 September of year y (a yearly circular's year): from 1.9.y to 31.8.y+1.
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`, y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the salary month is in the school year from` c y IF
        `the salary month is at least` c y 9
    AND NOT `the salary month is at least` c (y PLUS 1) 9

-- Whether a yearly owners' circular reaches the case: an owner's employee,
-- in the kind of school it is addressed to, in its school year.
GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`, k IS A `the kind of school in the case`, y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an owner's teacher in` c k y IF
        `is an owning body` (c's `employer`)
    AND c's `the kind of school` EQUALS k
    AND `the salary month is in the school year from` c y

§§ `התפקידים שהמקרה מחזיק`

-- The pay items that are a role's allowance, and whether the case holds
-- the role: the pedagogical coordinator's, a mentor's (one intern or more)
-- and the junior-division head's. The root answers what each instrument
-- says of the item whether or not the role is held; the month by the law
-- (l4/lib/salary-root.l4) pays it only where it is.
`the items a held role pays` MEANS
    LIST `the pedagogical coordinator's allowance rate`,
         `the mentor's allowance rate`,
         `the junior-division head's allowance`

GIVEN i IS A `pay item`, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the case holds the role of` i c IS
    CONSIDER i
    WHEN `the pedagogical coordinator's allowance rate` THEN c's `holds the pedagogical coordinator's role`
    WHEN `the mentor's allowance rate` THEN c's `the interns the teacher mentors` AT LEAST 1
    WHEN `the junior-division head's allowance` THEN c's `heads the junior division`
    OTHERWISE FALSE

GIVEN c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the roles held of those the root pays for` c IS
    count (filter (GIVEN i YIELD `the case holds the role of` i c) `the items a held role pays`)

§§ `תוספת מעונות`

-- The childcare supplement (parental rights) of the Wage Controller's
-- circular 2011-1-48 and the yearly updates of its amounts: one child and
-- one list of actions for the whole series, which every update reads in
-- the same terms (MMS-538).
@desc A child for whom the childcare supplement is claimed, as far as the yearly updates ask about it.
DECLARE `child for the childcare supplement` HAS
    `up to age 5`                   IS A BOOLEAN @desc the child is "עד גיל 5", the age the circulars name; who that is, and who may claim, is clause 11 of the framework agreement of 12.1.2011, which the updates do not restate
    `place among the children`      IS A NUMBER  @desc 1 for "ילד אחד / ילד ראשון" (an only or first child), 2 for "ילד שני" (a second child), counted as clause 11 of the framework agreement counts them

@desc What the employer does about the childcare supplement: pays it, or demands receipts (which circular 2011-1-48 forbids).
DECLARE `childcare supplement action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the childcare supplement` HAS `childcare amount paid` IS A NUMBER
    `demand receipts for the childcare costs`

§§ `מקדמי ההמרה למורים אקדמאיים`

-- The statuses by which the conversion-coefficient tables of the Ofek Hadash
-- circulars print the academic teacher's coefficient.
-- Declared once for 2019-20_tashaf_01, 2023-24_tashpad_01, 2023-24_tashpad_02, 2024-25_tashpah_01 (MMS-538).
@desc A teacher's status as the conversion-coefficient tables tell them apart: regular, mother, class educator, or both.
DECLARE `teacher's status for the coefficient` IS ONE OF
    `the status of a regular teacher`
    `the status of a mother`
    `the status of a class educator`
    `the status of a class educator and mother`

§§ `קצובת ביגוד — המקרה`

-- A teaching employee's school year at one employer, as the yearly
-- clothing-allowance circulars ask about it; each circular's own rules read
-- it for its own year.
-- Declared once for 2014-15_tashae_07, 2015-16_tashav_08, 2016-17_tashaz_06 (MMS-538).
@desc A teaching employee's school year at one employer, as far as the clothing allowance asks about it.
DECLARE `clothing case` HAS
    `graded as a teaching employee`        IS A BOOLEAN @desc graded on the teaching employees' grading scale
    `employed by a supervised owner`       IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed by an owner of education supervised by the Ministry of Education
    `position with this employer`          IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position held with this employer (1 = 100%)
    `position with all the employers`      IS A NUMBER  @desc the total position held with all employers together

§§ `דמי הבראה — ימים לפי ותק`

-- A row of the recuperation-pay circulars' table of days by years of
-- seniority; each circular states its own rows as data.
-- Declared once for 2009-10_tasha_03, 2010-11_tashaa_02, 2011-12_tashab_12 (MMS-538).
@desc A row of a recuperation-days table: from which year of seniority to which, and the days it gives.
DECLARE `havraa days band` HAS
    `from havraa year` IS A NUMBER
    `to havraa year`   IS A NUMBER @desc 999 stands for "ומעלה"
    `havraa band days` IS A NUMBER

§§ `קצובת ביגוד — לפי היקף משרה`

-- A row of the clothing-allowance circulars' table of amounts by employment
-- rate; each circular states its own rows as data.
-- Declared once for 2008-09_tashsat_10, 2009-10_tasha_05, 2010-11_tashaa_03 (MMS-538).
@desc A row of a part-time clothing table: from which employment rate to which, and the amount it pays.
DECLARE `employment band` HAS
    `from employment rate` IS A NUMBER
    `to employment rate`   IS A NUMBER  @desc 999 stands for "ומעלה"
    `employment band amount` IS A NUMBER

§§ `תפקידי היועץ`

-- One goal or function of a counsellor, as the takanon's approved lists
-- (sections 3.12, 4.12 and 5.12) state them.
-- Declared once for 3.12, 4.12, 5.12 (MMS-538).
@desc One goal or function of the counsellor, as an approved list states it.
DECLARE `counselling function` HAS
    `area of the function` IS A STRING
    `what the function is` IS A STRING

§§ `לשון זכר ונקבה, יחיד ורבים`

-- The forms of a word an agreement's interpretation clause speaks of
-- (masculine includes feminine, and the like); each agreement states its own
-- clause as a rule.
-- Declared once for 2022-10-19_ofek-hadash_wage-agreement, 2025-06-29_ofek-hadash_approved-teacher-agreement_wage-reduction-2025-2026, base-agreement-2 (MMS-538).
@desc A grammatical form of a word: masculine, feminine, singular or plural.
DECLARE `form of a word` IS ONE OF masculine, feminine, singular, plural

§§ `תחילת תקופת ההצטרפות`

-- When a period counted from joining Ofek Hadash in a recognised-unofficial
-- institution starts, as circulars 2022-23/1 and 2022-23/2 tell the two apart.
-- Declared once for 2022-23_tashpag_01, 2022-23_tashpag_02 (MMS-538).
@desc The day a period counted from joining the reform starts: the day the undertaking is signed or the day of joining.
DECLARE `start of the period` IS ONE OF
    `the date of signing the undertaking`
    `the date of joining the reform`

§§ `חלוקת שעות המשרה`

-- A post's hours divided into frontal, individual and presence hours, as
-- the Ofek Hadash circulars' tables print them.
-- Declared once for 2023-24_tashpad_03, 2024-25_tashpah_01 (MMS-538).
@desc A post's hours divided into frontal, individual and presence hours.
DECLARE `hours split` HAS
    `frontal part` IS A NUMBER
    `individual part` IS A NUMBER
    `presence part` IS A NUMBER

§§ `קצובת ביגוד — טבלת משרה חלקית`

-- A row of the part-time tables of the clothing-allowance circulars of
-- 2024-25 and 2025-26; each circular states its own rows as data.
-- Declared once for 2024-25_tashpah_12, 2025-26_tashpo_08 (MMS-538).
@desc A row of a part-time table: an employment rate and the amount it pays as at the date the table prints.
DECLARE `rate band` HAS
    `band above`           IS A NUMBER   @desc the band starts above this rate (or at it, where `band from inclusive`)
    `band from inclusive`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `band up to`           IS A NUMBER   @desc the band ends at this rate (or below it, where not `band to inclusive`); 999 stands for no upper bound
    `band to inclusive`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `band amount`          IS A NUMBER

§§ `משרה אצל מעסיק אחד`

-- One employer's share of a teaching employee's school year, as the
-- recuperation-pay circulars of 2012-13 and 2013-14 ask about it.
-- Declared once for 2012-13_tashag_07, 2013-14_tashad_07 (MMS-538).
@desc One employer's share of a teaching employee's school year.
DECLARE `employment with one employer` HAS
    `position at this employer` IS A NUMBER @desc the share of a full position held with this employer (1 = a full position)

§§ `גמול תפקיד מודפס`

-- One printed role bonus of the Ofek Hadash circulars' tables: the role and
-- its rate of the combined salary.
-- Declared once for 2023-24_tashpad_01, 2023-24_tashpad_02 (MMS-538).
@desc One printed role bonus: the role and its rate of the combined salary.
DECLARE `role bonus` HAS
    `bonus role` IS A STRING
    `bonus rate` IS A NUMBER

§§ `גמול ליווי פעילות`

-- One printed row of the escorting-activity table of the Ofek Hadash
-- circulars: when the activity ends and the bonus units.
-- Declared once for 2023-24_tashpad_01, 2023-24_tashpad_02 (MMS-538).
@desc One printed row of an escorting-activity table: when the activity ends (in hours of the day), and the bonus units.
DECLARE `escort band` HAS
    `band from hour` IS A NUMBER
    `band to hour`   IS A NUMBER
    `band units`     IS A NUMBER

§§ `רכיבי המקדמה`

-- The current (non-reform) salary components on which the Ofek Hadash
-- circulars compute the advance, for one month.
-- Declared once for 2023-24_tashpad_01, 2023-24_tashpad_02 (MMS-538).
@desc The current (non-reform) salary components the advance is computed on, for one month.
DECLARE `advance components` HAS
    `combined salary component`   IS A NUMBER
    `supplement 87`               IS A NUMBER
    `supplement 94`               IS A NUMBER
    `supplement 2001`             IS A NUMBER
    `supplement 2008`             IS A NUMBER
    `split-day bonus`             IS A NUMBER
    `in-service training bonuses` IS A NUMBER
    `double-degree bonus`         IS A NUMBER
    `supplement 2011`             IS A NUMBER

§§ `התוספות השקליות — תנאי העסקה`

-- The three groups the shekel-supplement circulars of 2012-13 price
-- separately.
-- Declared once for 2012-13_tashag_04, 2012-13_tashag_10 (MMS-538).
@desc The terms of employment by which the shekel supplements are priced.
DECLARE `employment terms for the shekel supplements` IS ONE OF
    `not employed under a reform, or a principal under Oz LeTmura`
    `a non-principal in partial implementation of Oz LeTmura`
    `a non-principal in full implementation of Oz LeTmura`

§§ `תחילת ארבע השנים`

-- When the four years counted from joining Ofek Hadash start, as circulars
-- 2020-21/1 and 2020-21/4 tell the two apart.
-- Declared once for 2020-21_tashpa_01, 2020-21_tashpa_04 (MMS-538).
@desc The day the four years start: the day the commitment was signed or the day of joining the reform.
DECLARE `start of the four years` IS ONE OF
    `the day the commitment was signed`
    `the day of joining the reform`

§§ `חלופות לתואר אקדמי`

-- The ways circulars 2020-21/1 and 2020-21/4 accept in place of an Israeli
-- academic degree.
-- Declared once for 2020-21_tashpa_01, 2020-21_tashpa_04 (MMS-538).
@desc What may stand for an academic degree.
DECLARE `academic degree alternative` IS ONE OF
    `a degree of a recognised Israeli institution recognised by the Council for Higher Education`
    `a foreign degree the Ministry's evaluation unit found equivalent`
    `studies giving a salary grade equal to the academic one, approved by the division or a district`

§§ `טופס מודפס`

-- A blank form a circular prints, by what it is for and the year printed on
-- it.
-- Declared once for 2022-23_tashpag_04, 2022-23_tashpag_05 (MMS-538).
@desc A printed blank: what it is for and the year printed on it.
DECLARE `printed blank` HAS
    `what the blank is for` IS A STRING
    `year printed`          IS A NUMBER

§§ `משרה אצל מעסיק`

-- One employer's share of a full position, as the jubilee and
-- recuperation circulars of 2017-18 and 2018-19 ask about it.
-- Declared once for 2017-18_tashach_04, 2018-19_tashat_06 (MMS-538).
@desc One employer's share of a full position (1 = a full position).
DECLARE `position with an employer` HAS
    `position fraction with the employer` IS A NUMBER @desc 1 = a full position
